# .graphifyignore — Android / Kotlin / Java / Gradle (code graph carve-out)
#
# Copied into the repo checkout at build time from the VAULT-side copy at
# graphify/<repo>/.graphifyignore, which is the reviewable, committed one.
# PURE DENYLIST — never add a `!negation` line; negation is not available here.
#
# Scope for this stack is every module's `src/main/` (java/ and kotlin/), built
# from the Gradle project root. res/ is deliberately NOT carved: graphify does not
# index XML today, and INNOV-427 will make layouts and manifests count.

# --- Gradle / IDE / native build state (never source) ----------------------
build/
.gradle/
.idea/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/
build-cache/
local.properties

# --- generated sources (kapt / ksp / databinding / BuildConfig) ------------
